  "releaseNotes": "19.1.0\n* Local validation now uses KoSIT XRechnung Schematron 2.6.0 (BR-TMP-2 is now fatal)\n* Embedded invoice XML in PDFs without /Filter entry is now extracted correctly\n* Broken or unsupported PDF stream filters are reported as findings instead of exceptions\n* Fixed global variables in Schematron functions in the local validation engine",
